*Relevant Formulae for Diatomic Gases:*

- First Law of Thermodynamics:
  $ Delta U = Q + W $

- Heat Capacity & Enthalpy:
  $ Q_P = Delta H = n C_P Delta T $
  $ Delta U = n C_V Delta T $

- Diatomic Gas (Kinetic Theory):
  $ C_V = (5) / (2) R, quad C_P = (7) / (2) R $
  $ gamma = (C_P) / (C_V) = 1.4 $

- Ideal Gas Law:
  $ P V = n R T $
